  ],
  "min_subjects": 5,
  "recipe": "generator numpy.random.default_rng(0) (PCG64); subjects in ascending identifier order; at every resample integers(0, n, n) with n = the number of subjects (16); the generator restarts from 0 for every training seed (the same 1,000 resamples for 42, 43 and 44); every metric computed on the pooled frames of the resampled subjects, not as a mean of per-subject values; the same subject indices for both experiments; percentiles 2.5 and 97.5 with np.percentile, linear interpolation; a resample without a class does not count for the metrics that need it; no interval with fewer than 5 subjects"
